{"id":"n1-032","title":"Noun ですら (~desura)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'even', 'as much as', used for emphasis in formal contexts.","longExplanation":"「Noun + ですら」emphasizes 'even' in a formal or literary tone. It can carry nuance similar to さえ or すら but is used more in writing or formal speech.","formation":"Noun + ですら","examples":[{"jp":"明日試験があるのに、彼はテキストですら読まない。","romaji":"Ashita shiken ga aru noni, kare wa tekisuto desura yomanai.","en":"He doesn’t even read the textbook, despite having a test tomorrow.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"のに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"テキスト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"すら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"読ま","vocabId":"1456360","reading":"よむ","baseForm":"読む"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9,10]},{"jp":"この問題は専門家ですら解けない。","romaji":"Kono mondai wa senmonka desura tokenai.","en":"Even an expert can’t solve this problem.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"専門","vocabId":"1389880","reading":"せんもん"},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"すら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解け","vocabId":"1198910","reading":"とける","baseForm":"解ける"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"彼女は最後のスピーチですら泣いてしまった。","romaji":"Kanojo wa saigo no supiichi desura naite shimatta.","en":"She ended up crying, even during the final speech.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"最後","vocabId":"1293810","reading":"さいご"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"スピーチ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"すら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣い","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なく","baseForm":"泣く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しまう"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"彼は毎日勉強しているが、基本の漢字ですら覚えられない。","romaji":"Kare wa mainichi benkyou shite iru ga, kihon no kanji desura oboerarenai.","en":"He studies every day, but can’t even remember basic kanji.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"基本","vocabId":"1219190","reading":"きほん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"漢字","vocabId":"1213170","reading":"かんじ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"すら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"覚え","vocabId":"1206040","reading":"おぼえ","baseForm":"覚える"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[12,13]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal emphasis \"even\" - written/formal register, used for a striking example.","family":{"id":"emphasis-even","name":"Emphasis (Even)","relatedPoints":["n4-114","n3-022","n2-089","n1-060","n3-099","n2-147","n1-030","n1-063"]}}